function\(\d+\)\s+: Recursion / \d+.\d+ ns main
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) / \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) 
.    function\(\d+\)\s+: Recursion / \d+.\d+ ns f
.    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) / \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) 
.    .    cond\(\d+\)\s+: Recursion / \d+.\d+ ns 
.    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ ns \(x 0\) / \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) 
.    .    .    seq\(\d+\)\s+: Recursion / \d+.\d+ ns 
.    .    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ ns \(x 1\) / \d+.\d+ ns \(x 0\)

